  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Mid 104.02 Communication with the Council. Persons wishing to make submissions to the council shall do so through the office of professional licensure and certification (OPLC) at the address provided in Mid 104.01(a).\n\nSource. #7412, eff 12-5-00; ss by #14496, eff 2-8-26",
